    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/d29c1702fca98267e2ce0e450a095053.poster.avif?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/d29c1702fca98267e2ce0e450a095053.webm?t=1749740573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/d29c1702fca98267e2ce0e450a095053.mp4?t=1749740573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nephelem: A Path of Vice and Virtue</strong> is a dark fantasy roguelite featuring intense and deliberate action combat, multiple build possibilities, and a lore-rich, beautifully stylized world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a former member of the <strong>Nephelem Order</strong>, once sworn to guard the passage between life and death, now living a quiet life in the mortal realm. But a personal tragedy forces you to return to the afterlife. In a world torn by eternal conflict, you must confront the past and uncover the mystery that brought you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/3180480dee6f5cf0eaf71913f048d853.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the afterlife across three distinct <strong>biomes</strong>, each with its own visual identity, soundtrack, lore, enemies, and combat encounters. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cathedral of Final Light</strong>: The gateway between the living and the dead. Once the stronghold of the Nephelem Order, it now stands corrupted by an unknown force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crucible</strong>: A realm once meant for reflection, where souls contemplated their lives before moving on. Now, it is a fractured battlefield, torn by an eternal war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sundering</strong>: A scorched void where lost souls are twisted into monstrous forms. This desolate place lies at the heart of the eternal conflict, and marks the final leg of your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/88b4f3c0a1c22c0dffcbdc9910d001af.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a former <strong>Nephelem warrior</strong>, you wield a powerful and diverse arsenal designed to support a wide range of playstyles. Choose a <strong>primary and secondary weapon</strong>, each with distinct mechanics, and equip <strong>powerful abilities</strong> to shape your strategy for every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll unlock new weapons, enhance them using materials found in the afterlife, and face ever-growing challenges that test your mastery. Whether you favor fast-paced aggression, calculated defense, or long-range control, <i>Nephelem</i> empowers you to fight your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/88256790af5377dca5237322b1f8f00f.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover lost knowledge from the <strong>Nephelem Order</strong>, you'll gain access to <strong>Virtues</strong>: powerful modifiers that dramatically shape your build each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Virtue category influences your character in <strong>distinct and meaningful ways</strong>, encouraging new strategies and creating unique synergies. No two runs will ever feel the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: the deeper you lean into certain choices, the more you're tempted by <strong>Vices</strong>. These twisted reflections of Virtues may offer <strong>seductive power</strong>, but always come with a <strong>cost</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/6eafc3ae296d4902b2bbbc16168783aa.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run in <i>Nephelem</i> takes you through a sequence of <strong>handcrafted areas</strong>, selected at random to create fresh challenges and encounters every time you play. The layout, enemies, and rewards shift, encouraging adaptation and experimentation towards victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you <strong>fall in</strong> <strong>battle</strong>, not all is lost! As a Nephelem warrior, death is merely a <strong>setback</strong>. Use the resources you gather to <strong>improve and adapt</strong>: unlock new weapons, and push deeper into the afterlife with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/aff60d22505ef5f573cbb0bc847912f8.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft a hero that resonates with you</strong>, from their appearance to the way they fight. Face the full experience of the afterlife and its mysteries on your own, or team up with others in <strong>online two player co-op</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/d29c1702fca98267e2ce0e450a095053.poster.avif?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/d29c1702fca98267e2ce0e450a095053.webm?t=1749740573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/d29c1702fca98267e2ce0e450a095053.mp4?t=1749740573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nephelem: A Path of Vice and Virtue</strong> is a dark fantasy roguelite featuring intense and deliberate action combat, multiple build possibilities, and a lore-rich, beautifully stylized world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a former member of the <strong>Nephelem Order</strong>, once sworn to guard the passage between life and death, now living a quiet life in the mortal realm. But a personal tragedy forces you to return to the afterlife. In a world torn by eternal conflict, you must confront the past and uncover the mystery that brought you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/3180480dee6f5cf0eaf71913f048d853.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the afterlife across three distinct <strong>biomes</strong>, each with its own visual identity, soundtrack, lore, enemies, and combat encounters. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cathedral of Final Light</strong>: The gateway between the living and the dead. Once the stronghold of the Nephelem Order, it now stands corrupted by an unknown force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crucible</strong>: A realm once meant for reflection, where souls contemplated their lives before moving on. Now, it is a fractured battlefield, torn by an eternal war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sundering</strong>: A scorched void where lost souls are twisted into monstrous forms. This desolate place lies at the heart of the eternal conflict, and marks the final leg of your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/88b4f3c0a1c22c0dffcbdc9910d001af.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a former <strong>Nephelem warrior</strong>, you wield a powerful and diverse arsenal designed to support a wide range of playstyles. Choose a <strong>primary and secondary weapon</strong>, each with distinct mechanics, and equip <strong>powerful abilities</strong> to shape your strategy for every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll unlock new weapons, enhance them using materials found in the afterlife, and face ever-growing challenges that test your mastery. Whether you favor fast-paced aggression, calculated defense, or long-range control, <i>Nephelem</i> empowers you to fight your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/88256790af5377dca5237322b1f8f00f.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover lost knowledge from the <strong>Nephelem Order</strong>, you'll gain access to <strong>Virtues</strong>: powerful modifiers that dramatically shape your build each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Virtue category influences your character in <strong>distinct and meaningful ways</strong>, encouraging new strategies and creating unique synergies. No two runs will ever feel the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: the deeper you lean into certain choices, the more you're tempted by <strong>Vices</strong>. These twisted reflections of Virtues may offer <strong>seductive power</strong>, but always come with a <strong>cost</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/6eafc3ae296d4902b2bbbc16168783aa.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run in <i>Nephelem</i> takes you through a sequence of <strong>handcrafted areas</strong>, selected at random to create fresh challenges and encounters every time you play. The layout, enemies, and rewards shift, encouraging adaptation and experimentation towards victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you <strong>fall in</strong> <strong>battle</strong>, not all is lost! As a Nephelem warrior, death is merely a <strong>setback</strong>. Use the resources you gather to <strong>improve and adapt</strong>: unlock new weapons, and push deeper into the afterlife with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935960/extras/aff60d22505ef5f573cbb0bc847912f8.webp?t=1749740573\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft a hero that resonates with you</strong>, from their appearance to the way they fight. Face the full experience of the afterlife and its mysteries on your own, or team up with others in <strong>online two player co-op</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "A dark fantasy action roguelite where you battle through the afterlife. Embrace powerful virtues, face the consequences of vices, and uncover the truth behind personal tragedy. Play solo or online co-op in a world torn by eternal conflict.",
